      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McWey Auctioneers are pleased to bring to the market 5 Belfry Court, a well-presented ground floor apartment ideally situated in this popular and convenient development.\r\n\r\nThe property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, comprising a bright and welcoming kitchen/living space, two spacious bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nLocated within a secure and well-maintained complex in the heart of Kildare town, the apartment is ideally positioned for those seeking both convenience and connectivity. The train station is within easy walking distance, while the M7 motorway is only a short drive away, making this an excellent choice for commuters.\r\n\r\nThe property would make an ideal purchase for a range of buyers, including:\r\n\r\n✅ First-time buyers\r\n✅ Investors\r\n✅ Those looking to downsize\r\n\r\nWith its convenient location, generous accommodation and excellent transport links, 5 Belfry Court represents an attractive opportunity in a highly sought-after \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
