        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t\t3.87 x 0.96\tTiled Flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPVC Hall Door\t\t\r\n \t\t\t\t\r\nKitchen/\r\nLiving  Area:\t          6 x 4.06\t\t Tiled Walls\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Fitted Units with integrated Electric  Oven &  Hob\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Carpeted Flooring\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nInside Hall:\t\t 2 x 1.06\t\tTiled Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\t\t3.94 x 3.05\tBuilt in units\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCarpeted flooring\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nEnsuite:\t\t\t2.3 x 1\t\tW.H.B  & W.C\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTiled Flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\t      0.94 x 2.26\tWood Flooring\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nBathroom:\t \t1.9 x .5\t\tBath, W.C & W.H.B.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTiled flooring"
